nd how to use the weapon you literally  just used the last one i'll mention is  right before the skyview temple  phi warns you that they detect zelda's  aura in the giant temple in front of you  and that there are numerous monsters  inside and asks if you want to proceed  and you actually have to say yes or no  if you say yes which i did of course  phi says not to be overconfident and if  you feel unprepared  you can return to the sky and get a  shield and potions you know  the same thing phi said earlier before  we even left the sky  in total i counted 17 situations where  phi's dialogue was changed or removed  entirely  if you want to know the others let me  know in the comments and i'd be happy to  write them out  or if you found some yourself then leave  those in the comments as well  it's possible that i missed some number  eight amiibo functionality  alongside the release of skyward sword  hd nintendo is releasing a zelda and  loftwing amiibo figure  the way the amiibo figure works is you  tap it when you're on the surface and  then you will immediately be transported  to the sky  instead of having to look for a bird  statue to do it then when you use the  amiibo again in the sky it'll return you  to the exact location where you tap the  amiibo on the surface  it even works in buildings and dungeons  unfortunately we did not have access to  the zelda and loftwing amiibo figure  before launch so i was not able to test  this functionality myself  you actually won't be able to use this  amiibo figure until after you've saved  gorko from the bokoblins and head to  farron woods for the first time  phi will pop out and let you know that  you can return to the sky and use the  amiibo to do it  amiibo are off by default in the  settings so you'll have to enable it  once phi mentions this  to use the amiibo hit down on the d-pad  to summon phi  and if you have amiibo enabled the  bottom left option will be to use amiibo  also yes i tried using a bunch of other  amiibo 